        <p class="lead-text">
          The <strong>Advanced Subtab</strong> provides a comprehensive toolkit for config creators, preset developers, and engine tweakers. It includes rule chips, forbidden CVar truth guides, and interactive diagnostic resolution tools.
        </p>

        <div class="alert alert-warning">
          <div class="alert-title">CANONICAL SECTION PREFIX CHIPS</div>
          <ul>
            <li><code>r.</code> → <code>[/Script/Engine.RendererSettings]</code></li>
            <li><code>s.</code> → <code>[/Script/Engine.StreamingSettings]</code></li>
            <li><code>gc.</code> → <code>[/Script/Engine.GarbageCollectionSettings]</code></li>
            <li><code>cook.</code> → <code>[/Script/UnrealEd.CookerSettings]</code></li>
            <li><code>[SystemSettings]</code> → Universal container for all general CVars.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
