            <ul>
              <li><code>Static</code> — Constants loaded once during engine initialization.</li>
              <li><code>Var 1</code> / <code>Var 2</code> / <code>Var 3</code> — CVars modified during scene loading or graphic changes.</li>
              <li><code>Hyper</code> — Rapidly updating runtime CVars per frame.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Displays <code>CVarExtractorDialog.kt</code> with TXT and CSV export options.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="editor-mode-box">
            <span class="mode-tag">Main Storage</span>
            <h4>Main Storage Reader (<code>MainStorageReaderDialog.kt</code>)</h4>
            <p>Inspects persistent backups stored in <code>context.filesDir/app_main_storage/</code>.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>View, copy, or share timestamped INI backups.</li>
              <li>1-tap <strong>Restore Backup</strong> button to revert to any previous configuration snapshot instantly.</li>
            </ul>
