            <p>All operations are logged in <code>context.filesDir/activity_log.txt</code>. You can inspect this anytime under <strong>Utilities &gt; Common Subtab &gt; View Backend Activity Log</strong>.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🐛</div>
            <h4>Report a Bug Generator (<code>BugReportDialog.kt</code>)</h4>
            <p>Tap <strong>"Report a Bug / Suggest a Feature"</strong> on the Support tab to open <code>BugReportDialog.kt</code>. It compiles hardware specs and backend logs to submit via Email, Discord, or GitHub Issues.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="card-icon">☕</div>
            <h4>Donations & Creator Support</h4>
            <p>WuWa Config Patcher is 100% free and ad-free. You can support Arglax directly via the in-app GCash / InstaPay QR dialog (<code>GCashDialog.kt</code>).</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="alert alert-tip" style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <div class="alert-title">DEVELOPER NOTES & RELEASE REPOSITORY</div>
          View release notes from Arglax regarding the platform migration to <strong>WuWa-Mobile-Config-Patcher</strong> on GitHub. Tap <strong>"Visit New Release Repository"</strong> on the Support tab to access releases directly at <a href="https://github.com/Arglax/WuWa-Mobile-Config-Patcher/releases" target="_blank" style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-weight: 800;">GitHub Releases</a>.
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Settings Screen: Danger Zone Actions</h2>
          <span class="author-tag">Tab 4: SettingsScreen &gt; Danger Zone</span>
        </div>

        <p class="lead-text">
          Normally collapsed in Settings. Expanding the Danger Zone reveals 3-step guarded confirmation actions for system cleanup and cache maintenance:
        </p>

        <div class="method-card">
          <h4>Guarded System Maintenance Routines</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Clear App Cache &amp; History:</strong> Wipes temporary repository zip caches and editor undo/redo snapshot stacks.</li>
            <li><strong>Clear App Data &amp; Exports:</strong> Complete factory reset clearing custom repository URLs, exported zips, and preference toggles.</li>
            <li><strong>Clear Activity Log:</strong> Erases <code>context.filesDir/activity_log.txt</code>.</li>
            <li><strong>Delete Shaders (<code>DeleteShadersDialog.kt</code>):</strong> Deletes Vulkan (<code>VulkanProgramBinaryCache</code>) or OpenGL (<code>ProgramBinaryCache</code>) compiled shader caches to fix rendering artifacts after game updates.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

