      <section class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>1-Click Preset Patching Workflow</h2>
          <span class="author-tag">Tab 1: ConfigScreen</span>
        </div>

        <p class="lead-text">
          The <strong>Config Screen</strong> is designed for instantaneous 1-tap graphics optimization. It automatically downloads, parses, backs up, and injects verified community and official graphic presets directly into your game directory.
        </p>

        <div class="method-card">
          <h4>End-User Quick Steps</h4>
          <ol class="step-list">
            <li><strong>Select Repository Source:</strong> By default, <code>Arglax (Default)</code> is active. Tap <strong>"Sync Files & Refresh"</strong> to fetch the latest presets.</li>
            <li><strong>Choose a Preset:</strong> Browse through organized categories (<code>STABLE</code>, <code>PERFORMANCE</code>, <code>HIGH_VISUAL</code>, <code>COMMUNITY</code>, <code>OTHER</code>).</li>
            <li><strong>Tap "1-Click Patch":</strong> The app creates a timestamped backup of your current setup and injects the new configuration.</li>
            <li><strong>Tap "Launch Game":</strong> Triggers Wuthering Waves directly with your active tweaks.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Technical Mechanics & Repository Architecture</h2>
          <span class="author-tag">ConfigScanner, ZipExtractor & Shizuku IPC</span>
        </div>

        <div class="editor-modes-container">
          <div class="editor-mode-box">
            <span class="mode-tag">Repository Sources</span>
            <h4>1. Repository Source Selector</h4>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Arglax (Default):</strong> Connects to GitHub API (<code>GitHubApi.kt</code>) to fetch preset metadata (<code>custom-metadata.txt</code>) and zip archives.</li>
              <li><strong>Custom Online Repository:</strong> Direct HTTP/HTTPS <code>.zip</code> download URL input.</li>
              <li><strong>Local Repository:</strong> Calls SAF tree picker (<code>OpenDocumentTree()</code>) to select local directories containing offline INI presets.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="editor-mode-box">
            <span class="mode-tag">Sync & Extraction</span>
            <h4>2. Sync Files & Deep Subfolder Scanning</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Downloads archives and extracts ZIPs via <code>ZipExtractor.kt</code> into <code>context.cacheDir/repo_cache/</code>.</li>
              <li>Parses preset folders using <code>ConfigScanner.kt</code> and <code>ConfigNode.kt</code>.</li>
              <li><strong>Deep Subfolder Fallback:</strong> Uses <code>folder.walkTopDown()</code> to discover nested <code>.ini</code> files in deep subfolders.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="editor-mode-box">
            <span class="mode-tag">Preset Categorization</span>
            <h4>3. Categorization & 1-Click Injection</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Categorizes presets into <code>STABLE</code>, <code>PERFORMANCE</code>, <code>HIGH_VISUAL</code>, <code>COMMUNITY</code>, and <code>OTHER</code> via <code>PresetCategorization.kt</code>.</li>
              <li><strong>Timestamped Backup:</strong> <code>MainStorageManager.kt</code> creates a backup snapshot in <code>app_main_storage/backups/</code>.</li>
              <li>Injects files via <code>ShizukuManager.applyAllIniFiles</code> directly into <code>.../Saved/Config/Android/</code>.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="alert alert-tip">
          <div class="alert-title">GEAR ICON ⚙️ PER-FILE PATCHING</div>
          Tapping the <strong>Gear Icon (⚙️)</strong> next to 1-Click Patch opens <code>AdvancedPatchDialog.kt</code>. This allows creators to selectively check/uncheck specific files (e.g. patching only <code>Engine.ini</code> while preserving <code>DeviceProfiles.ini</code>).
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="revert" class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Reverting to Vanilla (Factory Game Defaults)</h2>
          <span class="author-tag">Restoring Original State</span>
        </div>

        <p class="lead-text">
          If you experience graphical stutters, visual artifacts, or game updates, you can restore clean factory game defaults in two ways:
        </p>

        <div class="features-grid">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🔴</div>
            <h4>Standard Revert (1-Tap)</h4>
            <p>Go to <strong>Utilities &gt; Common &gt; Vanilla mode</strong> and tap the primary red <strong>"Revert to Vanilla"</strong> button. This safely executes elevated deletion of <code>Engine.ini</code>, <code>DeviceProfiles.ini</code>, and <code>Scalability.ini</code>, prompting Wuthering Waves to regenerate pristine defaults upon next launch.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="card-icon">⚙️</div>
            <h4>Advanced Revert & Backup Restores</h4>
            <p>Tap <strong>"Advanced Revert"</strong> (opens <code>AdvancedRevertDialog.kt</code>) to selectively delete individual INIs, or go to <a href="advanced-tools.html#extraction-storage" style="color: var(--accent-cyan); font-weight: 700;">Advanced Tools &gt; Main Storage</a> to restore a previous timestamped backup snapshot from <code>context.filesDir/app_main_storage/backups/</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>
