      </div>

      <section class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Common Utilities & Hardware Diagnostics</h2>
          <span class="author-tag">Tab 3: UtilitiesScreen (Common Subtab)</span>
        </div>

        <p class="lead-text">
          The <strong>Common Subtab</strong> on the Utilities tab provides essential tools for log decryption, live log filtering, device hardware scans, config exporting, and vanilla game reverts.
        </p>

        <div class="utilities-grid">
          <div class="util-item">
            <h4>🔍 Decrypted Log Explorer</h4>
            <p>Inline live line explorer for decrypted <code>Client.log</code> files with line numbers, search query input, and quick filter chips (<code>LogConfig</code>, <code>GameThread</code>, <code>Sharphereal</code>, <code>LogInit</code>, <code>LogTemp</code>, <code>Vulkan</code>, <code>RHI</code>).</p>
          </div>

          <div class="util-item">
            <h4>📱 Get Device Info</h4>
            <p>Invokes <code>DeviceStatsCollector.kt</code> to extract your exact GPU renderer model, Vulkan driver version, physical RAM, CPU core count, C# environment status, and game-evaluated <strong>Device Score</strong> from log headers.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="util-item">
            <h4>📦 Export & Sharing</h4>
            <p>Opens SAF tree folder (<code>PatchExporter.kt</code>) or compresses active live INI configs into a ZIP archive with custom naming dialog before opening the Android Sharesheet.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="util-item">
            <h4>🔓 Log Decryptor Engine</h4>
            <p>Decrypts obfuscated game logs via <code>LogDecryptor.kt</code> (supporting <strong>Scheme A</strong> XOR <code>0xA5/0xEF</code>, <strong>Scheme B</strong> XOR <code>0x55</code>, or plaintext fallback). Supports full-screen <code>DecryptedLogViewerDialog.kt</code> and Sharesheet export.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="util-item">
            <h4>🗑️ Delete Logs</h4>
            <p>Executes an elevated <code>rm -rf</code> command on the <code>.../Saved/Logs/</code> directory safely to clear GBs of bloated log files from internal storage.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="util-item">
            <h4>🔴 Revert to Vanilla</h4>
            <p>Safely deletes modified INI files (<code>Engine.ini</code>, <code>DeviceProfiles.ini</code>, <code>Scalability.ini</code>) to force Wuthering Waves to regenerate clean Kuro Games defaults upon launch.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="doc-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Backend Activity Log Traceability</h2>
          <span class="author-tag">ActivityLogDialog.kt</span>
